ory.\n\n### 🟡 Moderate:\n4. **RadeonSoftware (241s CPU, 224 MB)** — AMD recording/streaming features. \"Instant Replay\" or \"Record Desktop\" features are notorious for causing intermittent stutter in competitive games.\n5. **NoiseCancelingEngine** — Real-time audio processing that can interfere with game audio stack.\n\n### ✅ Normal:\n- cs2 — game itself\n- steamwebhelper — Steam's browser, necessary\n- claude/node — our session\n\nLet me present this analysis clearly to the user in Chinese.","signature":"4d6861ca-1172-4fe4-bc6e-fa8fbe7b4ec4"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":805,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":47872,"output_tokens":1241,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"201f2383-736f-4745-be4d-d508e78b3334","timestamp":"2026-05-29T12:30:51.421Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"0731615e-c605-4dd7-8156-28f0df4c34e1","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
{"parentUuid":"201f2383-736f-4745-be4d-d508e78b3334","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"4d6861ca-1172-4fe4-bc6e-fa8fbe7b4ec4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"数据拿到了。以下是分析结果：\n\n---\n\n## 你的 CS2 卡顿原因分析\n\n### CPU 占用排行（累计时间）\n\n| 进程 | CPU 时间(s) | 内存 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| cs2 | 1128 | 3.5 GB |\n| **RadeonSoftware** | **241** | 224 MB |\n| **EpicGamesLauncher** | **122** | 185 MB |\n| node (Claude) | 85 | 356 MB |\n| **audiodg** | 54 | 13 MB |\n| **抖音 ×7** | **合计 ~90** | ~400 MB |\n\n### 内存大户\n\n| 进程 | 内存 |\n|------|------|\n| cs2 | 3.5 GB |\n| **AMDChat** | **1.4 GB** |\n| claude | 570 MB |\n| steamwebhelper ×2 | 574 MB |\n| **EpicWebHelper ×3** | **451 MB** |\n\n---\n\n### 重点嫌疑（按影响排序）\n\n1. **AMDChat（1.4GB）** — AMD 用户体验程序，纯属 AMD 驱动捆绑的臃肿软件。在后台收集数据时会突然占用大量资源，导致游戏瞬间掉帧。\n\n2. **EpicGamesLauncher + 3×EpicWebHelper（~120s CPU + 450MB）** — Epic 后台在跑，三个 Web Helper 进程。可能在后台检查更新、刷新好友列表或缓存，瞬间读写磁盘会造成卡顿。\n\n3. **抖音 ×7 个进程** — 7 个抖音进程在后台跑，占用 CPU 和内存。视频解码器可能与游戏争抢 GPU 资源。\n\n4. **RadeonSoftware（241s CPU）** — AMD 驱动面板。如果你开了 **Instant Replay（即时回放）** 或 **桌面录制**，这是已知的竞技游戏卡顿元凶——它每隔一段时间写磁盘缓冲区。\n\n5. **NoiseCancelingEngine** — 实时音频降噪，可能与游戏音频管线冲突。\n\n---\n\n### 建议你做的事\n\n- **关掉 AMDChat**：在任务管理器结束它，或者卸载 AMD Software 时选 \"Driver Only\"\n- **关闭 Epic 后台**：Epic 设置里关掉「开机启动」和「后台运行」\n- **关掉 Radeon 录制功能**：AMD Software → 设置 → 媒体 → 关掉 Instant Replay / Record Desktop\n- **打 CS 前关掉抖音**：特别是多个抖音窗口\n- **关闭音频降噪**：如果不需要麦克风降噪，结束 NoiseCancelingEngine\n\n这几项处理完，卡顿应该会明显改善。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":805,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":47872,"output_tokens":1241,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"6ebda50b-9029-4a50-9114-0ee4f02e5212