{"parentUuid":"a5559047-dea9-41b0-9eaa-649b9183c22a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"45c7e26a-ba73-4659-b2b4-c1a685adc672","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_yuv6OsyAEdauoTIXhZVs1597","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\13751\\Desktop\\清理游戏后台.bat","content":"@echo off\n:: 以管理员权限重新运行自身\n>nul 2>&1 \"%SYSTEMROOT%\\system32\\cacls.exe\" \"%SYSTEMROOT%\\system32\\config\\system\"\nif '%errorlevel%' NEQ '0' (\n    echo 正在请求管理员权限...\n    goto UACPrompt\n) else ( goto gotAdmin )\n\n:UACPrompt\n    echo Set UAC = CreateObject^(\"Shell.Application\"^) > \"%temp%\\getadmin.vbs\"\n    echo UAC.ShellExecute \"%~s0\", \"\", \"\", \"runas\", 1 >> \"%temp%\\getadmin.vbs\"\n    \"%temp%\\getadmin.vbs\"\n    del \"%temp%\\getadmin.vbs\"\n    exit /B\n\n:gotAdmin\npushd \"%CD%\"\nCD /D \"%~dp0\"\n\necho ========================================\necho   游戏后台进程清理工具\necho ========================================\necho.\n\necho [1/6] 关闭抖音...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process douyin -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  抖音 - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [2/6] 关闭 AMD 臃肿软件...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'AMDChat','AMDRSServ' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  AMDChat, AMDRSServ - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [3/6] 关闭 Epic 后台...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'EpicGamesLauncher','EpicWebHelper' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  Epic - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [4/6] 关闭 Radeon 驱动面板...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'RadeonSoftware' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  RadeonSoftware - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [5/6] 关闭音频降噪...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'NoiseCancelingEngine' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  NoiseCancelingEngine - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [6/6] 关闭 Chromium 系浏览器后台（可选）...\npowe