噪...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'NoiseCancelingEngine' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null; Write-Host '  NoiseCancelingEngine - 已关闭'\"\necho.\n\necho [6/6] 关闭 Chromium 系浏览器后台（可选）...\npowershell -Command \"Get-Process -Name 'chrome','msedge' -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Where-Object { $_.MainWindowTitle -eq '' } | Stop-Process -Force 2>$null\"\necho.\n\necho ========================================\necho   清理完成！可以开始游戏了。\necho ========================================\necho.\necho   按任意键关闭此窗口...\npause >nul\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6df5ae06-dc55-4b61-9620-422f5c6fed70","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\13751","sessionId":"0731615e-c605-4dd7-8156-28f0df4c34e1","version":"2.1.142","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
